<title>USA: U.S. stockpile revises FY97 tin sales plan.</title>
<headline>U.S. stockpile revises FY97 tin sales plan.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center has revised its monthly tin sales program for FY1997.</p>
<p>The stockpile had originally planned to offer up to 200 tonnes of tin on the first Tuesday of very month beginning in October, 1996. The monthly tin sales will now be held on the first Wednesday of every month. The first sale is scheduled for November 6, 1996.</p>
</text>
